  "description": "A purely functional modelling layer for MILP and SMT solvers. Constraints are immutable expressions that read like the mathematics they represent: (a + h <= b) | (b + h <= a). Boolean structure is lowered to linear constraints automatically, with big-M values derived from variable bounds. The underlying solver is swappable.",
